.TH CHTTPCLI_CONSTRUCT_SCOPED 3 "2026-07-10" "c_collections" "C Collections Library - Macros"
.SH NAME
chttpcli_construct_scoped \- declare, initialise, and auto-destroy a chttpcli handle
.SH LIBRARY
C Collections (libccollections, \-lccollections)
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
#include <chttpclient.h>

chttpcli_construct_scoped(name)
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
.nf
Combines chttpcli_declare_scoped and the create_chttpclient call:
declares name with GCC cleanup attribute, calls create_chttpclient,
and sets name.  The client is destroyed automatically when name leaves
scope.  On failure, calls fatal_err() and does not return.
.fi
.SH PARAMETERS
.nf
name     Identifier for the new handle variable.
.fi
.SH "SEE ALSO"
.BR chttpcli_construct (3),
.BR chttpcli_declare_scoped (3),
.BR ___chttpclient_destroy (3)
